[al:新概念英语（一）]
[ar:MP3 同步字幕版（美音）]
[ti:The Most Expensive Model]
[by:更多学习内容，请到VeryCD.com搜索“露珠”]

[00:00.86]Lesson 111 | 第111课
[00:04.25]The most expensive model | 最贵的型号
[00:08.02]Listen to the tape then answer this question. | 听录音,然后回答这个问题。
[00:13.90]Can Mr. Frith buy the television on instalments? How does it work? | 弗里斯先生能分期付款买这台电视机吗?怎么运作的?
[00:23.63]I like this television very much. | 我非常喜欢这台电视机。
[00:27.23]How much does it cost? | 它多少钱?
[00:30.53]It's the most expensive model in the shop. | 它是店里最贵的型号。
[00:34.61]It costs five hundred pounds. | 它要500英镑。
[00:38.79]That's too expensive for us. | 那对我们来说太贵了。
[00:42.33]We can't afford all that money. | 我们付不起那么多钱。
[00:45.99]This model's less expensive than that one. | 这个型号比那个便宜些。
[00:50.08]It's only three hundred pounds. | 它只要300英镑。
[00:53.06]But, of course, it's not as good as the expensive one. | 但是,它当然没有那个贵的那么好。
[00:59.95]I don't like this model. | 我不喜欢这个型号。
[01:02.78]The other model's more expensive, but it's worth the money. | 那个型号更贵,但它值这个价。
[01:09.36]Can we buy it on instalments? | 我们可以分期付款买吗?
[01:13.12]Of course. | 当然可以。
[01:14.59]You can pay a deposit of thirty pounds, | 您可以先付30英镑的定金,
[01:18.63]and then fourteen pounds a month for three years. | 然后每月14英镑,分3年付清。
[01:24.54]Do you like it, dear? | 亲爱的,您喜欢吗?
[01:27.69]I certainly do, but I don't like the price. | 我当然喜欢,但我不喜欢这个价钱。
[01:33.01]You always want the best, but we can't afford it. | 您总想要最好的,但我们买不起。
[01:38.98]Sometimes you think you're a millionaire! | 有时您还以为自己是百万富翁!
[01:45.28]Millionaires don't buy things on instalments! | 百万富翁不会分期付款买东西!